title: "GLP-1 clinical-impact analysis code (Part II)"
abstract: >-
  Statistical analysis code for the GLP-1 receptor agonist weight and HbA1c
  study: cohort construction, persistence-of-therapy censoring, generalized
  estimating equation trajectory models and Cox proportional hazards
  time-to-threshold models.
